// The same query as ../allocation_by_department.dax on the hidden plain (naive) form of the measure, so that before and after run the same query.
// Slow measure 3, plain form, shaped like a bar chart: the Allocated Amount of all years by department of the current structure.
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS (
    'Department (current structure)'[Department Number],
    "allocated", [Allocated Amount (naive)]
)
ORDER BY 'Department (current structure)'[Department Number]
